    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Talking about a novel",
     "texto": [
      "**Fortellerstemme** is the voice that narrates a story; **synsvinkel**, the point of view from which it is told.",
      "**Undertekst** is what the text suggests without saying it directly. An interpretation can be **flertydig** (allow more than one meaning)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
   ]
  },
